    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to be nice. it feels like a lie. if i were actually a good person i wouldn't be carrying this much shame. it feels like i've reached a point where there's no point in trying to \"process\" it anymore. it's just heavy and permanent. sometimes i think maybe the only way to actually deal with it is to just stop. does that even make sense? that maybe ending it is just the most logical way for someone like me to just... stop hurting everyone?",
